    },
    {
      "content": "The concert schedule specifies a **15-minute encore**. Thus, Elaina’s final concert, including the encore, lasts:\n\n\\[\n65+15=80\\text{ minutes}\n\\]\n\nHer usual concert runtime remains:\n\n\\[\n65\\div 3=21\\tfrac{2}{3}\\text{ minutes}\n\\]\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{21\\tfrac{2}{3}\\text{ minutes}}\n\\]",
      "role": "assistant"
    },
